id: SEC-018
title: Timing-unsafe secret comparison (CWE-208)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .js .ts .py .rb .go .java
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: (hmac|signature|token|digest|hash)\s*={2,3}\s*
    message: "String comparison of secret/HMAC value — timing side-channel leaks correct value byte by byte"
fix: Use crypto.timingSafeEqual() (Node), hmac.compare_digest() (Python), SecureComparator (Java), or secure_compare (Ruby).